{"3629550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BERENICE: Videogame", "steam_appid": 3629550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629550/extras/e278a44afebfea0ba0f08f78541ff4c6.avif?t=1760515920\" width=1043 height=316 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into the world of the Endless Palace</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BERENICE</strong> is a gothic horror roguelite where every step is a trial, and the palace around you lives its own mysterious life.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Herman</strong>, a hunter trapped inside the <strong>Endless Palace</strong>, forced to fight for survival in a world where <strong>architecture defies the laws of physics</strong> and <strong>shadows whisper thoughts that aren’t yours</strong>.<br>His goal: his long-lost beloved, <strong>Berenice</strong>, whose voice echoes through a labyrinth of halls, bridges, and arches.<br>But the palace will not let him go so easily...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A procedurally endless palace</strong><br>Each section reshapes itself - there is no path to memorize. You can only move forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three major biomes -</strong> Edinburgh, the Sunken City, and the Palace Vaults<br>Each with its own logic, mood, and lore-bound boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible combat and weapon builds - </strong>Pick up, discard, adapt on the go. Every weapon has its own durability and playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive memories -</strong>Unlock fragments of the past through the journal. Control shadows. Customize the face of Berenice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A philosophical story of order, fear, and obsession - </strong>Herman searches for peace - but the deeper he goes, the more the palace becomes him.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio as orientation - </strong>Silence deceives. Hums guide. Berenice’s voice calls - but where?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn’t just a horror-action game. </strong>It’s a question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Where do you go when the path never ends?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629550/extras/107abbc520ba66eb4e3ac8e9c7136b0e.avif?t=1760515920\" width=1119 height=325 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629550/extras/e278a44afebfea0ba0f08f78541ff4c6.avif?t=1760515920\" width=1043 height=316 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into the world of the Endless Palace</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BERENICE</strong> is a gothic horror roguelite where every step is a trial, and the palace around you lives its own mysterious life.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Herman</strong>, a hunter trapped inside the <strong>Endless Palace</strong>, forced to fight for survival in a world where <strong>architecture defies the laws of physics</strong> and <strong>shadows whisper thoughts that aren’t yours</strong>.<br>His goal: his long-lost beloved, <strong>Berenice</strong>, whose voice echoes through a labyrinth of halls, bridges, and arches.<br>But the palace will not let him go so easily...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A procedurally endless palace</strong><br>Each section reshapes itself - there is no path to memorize. You can only move forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three major biomes -</strong> Edinburgh, the Sunken City, and the Palace Vaults<br>Each with its own logic, mood, and lore-bound boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible combat and weapon builds - </strong>Pick up, discard, adapt on the go. Every weapon has its own durability and playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive memories -</strong>Unlock fragments of the past through the journal. Control shadows. Customize the face of Berenice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A philosophical story of order, fear, and obsession - </strong>Herman searches for peace - but the deeper he goes, the more the palace becomes him.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio as orientation - </strong>Silence deceives. Hums guide. Berenice’s voice calls - but where?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn’t just a horror-action game. </strong>It’s a question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Where do you go when the path never ends?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629550/extras/107abbc520ba66eb4e3ac8e9c7136b0e.avif?t=1760515920\" width=1119 height=325 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Trapped in an ever-shifting palace, a man searches for his lost beloved - but the deeper he goes, the more the world, and his mind, collapse into something else.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629550/8173f2d67b241c5b96fe1ace7e9903870f6afa6d/header.jpg?t=1760515920", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629550/2fbe6432b5de744910044157072996ab684fd